WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.935
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.935 --> 00:00:04.004
We hope you're all
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.238
And now, we're going to
get to the news.

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:08.341
President Biden hosted
the first movie screening

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:10.477
of his presidency tonight
at the White House.

00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:13.112
And according to Jill, his last.

00:00:13.112 --> 00:00:15.114
"Who's that again?

00:00:15.114 --> 00:00:17.617
Why is she mad at him?
Did that guy just die?"

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:19.085
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:22.756
Tesla CEO Elon Musk tweeted
yesterday that former president

00:00:22.756 --> 00:00:26.091
Donald Trump's platform Truth
Social has a terrible name.

00:00:26.091 --> 00:00:29.062
Um, okay, "Elon Musk."

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:31.530
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:34.968
Dr. Anthony Fauci said this week
that the country is now

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:38.470
out of the pandemic phase of
the coronavirus and firmly in

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:41.641
the "remembering how to
talk to people" phase.

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:44.577
"Hello, coworker!
How was your weekend?

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:47.180
Plus, what's a sad memory
from your childhood?"

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.148
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:52.886
In newly released excerpts from
a deposition taken last year,

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.021
former president Trump said that
he was worried

00:00:55.021 --> 00:00:58.258
that protesters might throw
fruits and vegetables at him.

00:00:58.258 --> 00:01:03.229
This is just more proof that
Trump only thinks in cartoons.

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:06.499
"They could throw tomatoes,
or worse, someone could drop

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:10.202
an anvil on my head,
and then cracks would appear

00:01:10.202 --> 00:01:12.572
on my face and body, and I might
crumple into a pile of dust

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.941
with just two eyeballs
sitting on top.

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:18.211
And then, folks, the eyeballs,
the eyeballs would blink twice."

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:20.046
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.046 --> 00:01:23.015
Goonk, goonk.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.015 --> 00:01:26.652
According to the latest numbers,
$7 billion of military equipment

00:01:26.652 --> 00:01:28.488
was left in Afghanistan
last year

00:01:28.488 --> 00:01:30.423
after the U.S. withdrew
from the country.

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:32.325
It's the oldest trick
in the book --

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:34.493
leave something behind
after the breakup

00:01:34.493 --> 00:01:36.695
to give you an excuse
to go back.

00:01:36.695 --> 00:01:39.999
"Yeah, hey, did I leave
some Humvees over there?"

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:41.500
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:44.870
According to a new poll, nearly
80% of Americans are concerned

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:47.774
about misinformation influencing
the outcome of November's

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:51.244
midterm elections, and about 35%
are counting on it.

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:52.879
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:54.647
Senate Majority Leader
Chuck Schumer

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:57.650
and House Speaker Nancy Pelosi
today announced a new plan

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:58.817
to lower gas prices.

00:01:58.817 --> 00:02:01.120
It's essentially a new gas pump

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:04.457
where every third gallon
is just Arizona iced tea.

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:06.059
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.059 --> 00:02:08.694
Russian President Vladimir Putin
said yesterday that

00:02:08.694 --> 00:02:11.764
if any country interferes with
his attack on Ukraine,

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:14.667
"they must know our response to
counterstrikes will be

00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:16.669
lightning fast,
unless, of course,

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:18.838
there's a little bit of mud."

00:02:18.838 --> 00:02:20.973
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.973 --> 00:02:23.909
A family in Illinois recently
found a bag of McDonald's

00:02:23.909 --> 00:02:26.078
French fries while renovating
their home that may

00:02:26.078 --> 00:02:28.213
have been in the wall
for more than 60 years.

00:02:28.213 --> 00:02:31.551
Man! It is hard to believe that
60 years ago,

00:02:31.551 --> 00:02:34.087
those fries were hot
for three minutes.

00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:36.655
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.655 --> 00:02:39.959
And finally, the NFL Draft kicks
off tonight in Las Vegas,

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:42.695
where 31 lucky players
will avoid the Jets.

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:44.931
And that, you guys,
was a monologue.

